    <h1 class="doc-title">TEST DESIGN SPECIFICATION (TDS)</h1>

    <h2 class="section-title">1. Requirements</h2>
    <p><strong>RQ-001:</strong> The system shall allow cashiers to log in using valid registered email and password credentials.</p>
    <p><strong>RQ-002:</strong> The system shall validate login attempts, rejecting invalid credentials and displaying an appropriate error message.</p>
    <p><strong>RQ-003:</strong> The system shall provide real-time product search by product name or SKU keyword on the POS interface.</p>
    <p><strong>RQ-004:</strong> The system shall allow cashiers to add in-stock products to the order cart and dynamically calculate quantities and subtotals.</p>
    <p><strong>RQ-005:</strong> The system shall prevent out-of-stock products (stock = 0) from being added to the cart and restrict cart quantity from exceeding available physical inventory.</p>
    <p><strong>RQ-006:</strong> The system shall calculate the total bill dynamically and determine the exact change based on received payment amount.</p>
    <p><strong>RQ-007:</strong> The system shall validate cash payments and reject checkout if the received cash amount is less than the total bill.</p>
    <p><strong>RQ-008:</strong> The system shall process checkout transactions atomically, decrement inventory, and generate printable receipts.</p>
    <p><strong>RQ-009:</strong> The system shall allow cashiers to review historical sales orders, filter by date range, inspect itemized details, and reprint receipts.</p>
    <p><strong>RQ-010:</strong> The system shall provide real-time stock monitoring, critical low-stock alerts, quick restock, and stock adjustment (stock opname) with mutation audit logs.</p>
    <p><strong>RQ-011:</strong> The system shall provide responsive navigation across cashier modules and allow cashiers to log out securely from any screen.</p>

    <h2 class="section-title">2. Feature Sets</h2>

    <div class="fs-block">
        <div class="fs-title">FS-001 – Cashier Authentication</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Objective: Authenticate and authorize cashier access into the POS system.</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Priority: High</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Traceability: RQ-001, RQ-002</div>
    </div>

    <div class="fs-block">
        <div class="fs-title">FS-002 – Product Catalog &amp; Search</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Objective: Display retail menu catalog and filter products dynamically.</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Priority: Medium</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Traceability: RQ-003</div>
    </div>

    <div class="fs-block">
        <div class="fs-title">FS-003 – Cart Management</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Objective: Manage order items, enforce stock limits, and prevent out-of-stock selection.</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Priority: High</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Traceability: RQ-004, RQ-005</div>
    </div>

    <div class="fs-block">
        <div class="fs-title">FS-004 – Checkout &amp; Payment Processing</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Objective: Calculate billings, validate payment sufficiency, and record sales transactions.</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Priority: High</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Traceability: RQ-006, RQ-007, RQ-008</div>
    </div>

    <div class="fs-block">
        <div class="fs-title">FS-005 – Receipt Printing</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Objective: Generate checkout receipts and support reprinting historical invoices.</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Priority: High</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Traceability: RQ-008, RQ-009</div>
    </div>

    <div class="fs-block">
        <div class="fs-title">FS-006 – Order History</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Objective: Review sales records, filter transactions by dates, and inspect item details.</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Priority: Medium</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Traceability: RQ-009</div>
    </div>

    <div class="fs-block">
        <div class="fs-title">FS-007 – Cashier Stock Management</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Objective: Monitor stock levels, perform quick restock, and record stock opname adjustments.</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Priority: High</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Traceability: RQ-010</div>
    </div>

    <div class="fs-block">
        <div class="fs-title">FS-008 – Session &amp; Navigation</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Objective: Provide responsive navigation and secure session logout.</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Priority: High</div>
        <div class="fs-detail">Traceability: RQ-011</div>
    </div>

